So I was browsing a free e-books web-site and saw Nietzsche's "Beyond Good
and Evil" and though "hmmm, now how would one say that in lojban" (the
actual title page of the book was in german or something which is what made
me think of trying to translate the title).

The closest thing that I could come up with was {ze'o co'e lo vrude .e lo
palci}.  How should lojban handle vagueness of this kind?  Anybody have any
suggestions/critiques?

mi'e cribe

